{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1co-6-1","title":"1 Corinthians 6:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The Corinthians must not vex their brethren, in going to law with them; 6 especially under infidels. 9 The unrighteous shall not inherit the kingdom of God. 15 Our bodies are the members of Christ, and temples of the Holy Ghost: they must not therefore be defiled.</p>\n<p>having. Mt 18:15-17; Ac 18:14,15; 19:38 go. 6,7 the saints. 1:2; 14:33; 16:1,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-2","title":"1 Corinthians 6:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the saints. Ps 49:14; 149:5-9; Da 7:18,22; Zec 14:5; Mt 19:28; Lu 22:30 1Th 3:13; Jude 1:14,15; Re 2:26,27; 3:21; 20:4 the smallest. 4; 2Co 4:18; 1Jo 2:16,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-3","title":"1 Corinthians 6:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>judge. Mt 25:41; 2Pe 2:4; Jude 1:6 pertain. 4; Ps 17:14; Lu 8:14; 21:34; 2Ti 2:4; 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-4","title":"1 Corinthians 6:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>ye. 5:12 who. Ac 6:2-4 least.The apostle perhaps meant that the meanest persons in the church were competent to decide the causes which they brought before the heathen magistrates.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-5","title":"1 Corinthians 6:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>to your. 4:14; 11:14; 15:34 Is it. 3:18; 4:10; Pr 14:8; Jas 1:5; 3:13-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-6","title":"1 Corinthians 6:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>brother. 1,7; Ge 13:7-9; 45:24; Ne 5:8,9; Ps 133:1-3; Ac 7:26; Php 2:14,15 1Jo 2:9-11; 3:11-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-7","title":"1 Corinthians 6:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>there. Pr 2:5,8-10; Ho 10:2; Jas 4:1-3 Why. Pr 20:22; Mt 5:39-41; Lu 6:29; Ro 12:17-19; 1Th 5:15; 1Pe 2:19-23 1Pe 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-8","title":"1 Corinthians 6:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Le 19:13; Mic 2:2; Mal 3:5; *marg: Mr 10:19; Col 3:25; 1Th 4:6; Jas 5:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-9","title":"1 Corinthians 6:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Know. 2,3,15,16,19; 3:16; 9:24 unrighteous. Ex 23:1; Le 19:15,35,36; De 25:13-16; Pr 11:1; 22:8; Isa 10:1,2 Isa 55:7; Zec 5:3; Ac 24:25; Ro 1:18; 1Ti 1:9 inherit. 10; 15:50; Mt 19:29; 25:34; Ga 5:21 fornicators. 5:1,10; Ga 5:19-21; Eph 5:4,5; 1Ti 1:9; Heb 12:14,16; 13:4; Re 21:8 Re 22:15 abusers. Ge 19:5; Le 18:22; 20:13; De 22:5; 23:17; Jud 19:22; Ro 1:26,27 1Ti 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-10","title":"1 Corinthians 6:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>thieves. Ps 50:17,18; Isa 1:23; Jer 7:11; Eze 22:13,27,29; Mt 21:19 Mt 23:14,33; Joh 12:6; Eph 4:28; 1Th 4:6; 1Pe 4:15 covetous. 5:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-11","title":"1 Corinthians 6:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>such. 12:2; Ro 6:17-19; Eph 2:1-3; 4:17-22; 5:8; Col 3:5-7; Tit 3:3-6 1Pe 4:2,3 but ye are washed. Ps 51:2,7; Pr 30:12; Isa 1:16; Jer 4:14; Eze 36:25; Joh 13:10 Ac 22:16; Eph 5:26; Tit 3:5; Heb 10:22; 1Pe 3:21; Re 1:5; 7:14 but ye are sanctified. 1:2,30; Ac 26:18; Ga 5:22,23; 2Th 2:13; Heb 2:11; 1Pe 1:2,22 but ye are justified. Isa 45:25; 53:11; Lu 18:14; Ac 13:39; Ro 3:24,26-30; 4:5; 5:1,9 Ro 8:30,33; Ga 2:16; 3:8,11,24; Tit 3:7; Jas 2:21-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-12","title":"1 Corinthians 6:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>things are lawful. 10:23; Ro 14:14 are not. 8:4,7-13; 9:12; 10:24-33; Ro 14:15-23; 2Th 3:9 but I. 9:27; Ro 7:14; Heb 12:15,16; Jude 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-13","title":"1 Corinthians 6:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Meats for. Mt 15:17,20; Mr 7:19; Ro 14:17 but God. 10:3-5; Joh 6:27,49; Col 2:22,23 but for. 15,19; 3:16; Ro 6:12; 7:4; 12:1; 14:7-9; 2Co 5:15; 11:2; Eph 5:23 1Th 4:3-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-14","title":"1 Corinthians 6:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>God. 15:15-20; Ac 2:24; 17:31; Ro 6:4-8; 8:11; 2Co 4:14; Php 3:10,11 1Th 4:14 by. Joh 5:28,29; 6:39,40; 11:25,26; Eph 1:19,20; Php 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-15","title":"1 Corinthians 6:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>your. 19; 11:3; 12:27; Ro 12:5; Eph 1:22,23; 4:12,15,16; 5:23,30; Col 2:19 God. Ge 44:17; Lu 20:16; Ro 3:3,4,6,31; 6:2,15; 7:7,13; Ga 2:17; 3:21 Ga 6:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-16","title":"1 Corinthians 6:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>an harlot. Ge 34:31; 38:15,24; Jud 16:1; Mt 21:31,32; Heb 11:31 for. Ge 2:24; Mt 19:5,6; Mr 10:8; Eph 5:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-17","title":"1 Corinthians 6:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>12:13; Joh 3:6; 17:21-23; Eph 4:3,4; 5:30; Php 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-18","title":"1 Corinthians 6:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Flee. Ge 39:12-18; Pr 2:16-19; 5:3-15; 6:24-32; 7:5-23,24-27; 9:16-18 Ro 6:12,13; 2Ti 2:22; Heb 13:4; 1Pe 2:11 sinneth. Ro 1:24; 1Th 4:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-19","title":"1 Corinthians 6:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>What. 15,16 your body. 3:16; 2Co 6:16; Eph 2:21,22; 1Pe 2:5 and ye. 1Ki 20:4; 1Ch 29:14; Ps 12:4; 100:3; Ro 14:7-9; 2Co 5:15; Tit 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-6-20","title":"1 Corinthians 6:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>ye. 7:23; Ac 20:28; Ga 3:13; Heb 9:12; 1Pe 1:18; 2Pe 2:1; Re 5:9 God. 10:31; Mt 5:16; Ro 6:19; 12:1; Php 1:20; 1Pe 2:9</p>"}]}